## Summary

This PR adds native SenseNova U1 support to main SGLang, including:

- native language and multimodal-understanding execution;
- native bounded flow matching for image generation;
- OpenAI-compatible T2I and IT2I image APIs;
- flow-prefill CUDA graph capture and replay;
- scheduler-owned text-to-image-to-text interleave continuation;
- deterministic, batch-size-invariant interleave image generation;
- reusable official-HF versus native end-to-end benchmark tooling.

The final cross-batch correctness fix is commit
`581e47848d6791e5134c19ecd9763283fdd547b9`. It prevents the internal flow
child from reusing parent KV generated under a concurrency-dependent text batch.
